{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Difference of Squares Identity.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Difference of Squares Identity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"difference of squares identity difference of squares identity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Difference of Squares Identity.md","fileName":"Difference of Squares Identity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Difference of Squares Identity","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:41\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Factoring and Algebraic Identities]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Factoring and Algebraic Identities","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Difference of Squares Identity.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Difference of Squares Identity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"difference of squares identity difference of squares identity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Difference of Squares Identity.md","fileName":"Difference of Squares Identity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Difference of Squares Identity","heading":"Difference of Squares Identity","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The difference of squares identity is\n\n$$a^2-b^2=(a-b)(a+b).$$\n\nThe two factors are conjugate binomials. When expanded, the cross terms (-ab) and (ab) cancel, leaving only the two squares.\n\nThe identity can be used in either direction for expansion, factorization, or exact calculation. Compound expressions may serve as (a) and (b), and repeated use can continue a factorization, as in (x^4-16=(x^2-4)(x^2+4)=(x-2)(x+2)(x^2+4)).","tags":["baby"],"links":["Factoring and Algebraic Identities","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Difference of Squares Identity.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Difference of Squares Identity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"difference of squares identity difference of squares identity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Difference of Squares Identity.md","fileName":"Difference of Squares Identity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Difference of Squares Identity","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[algebraessentials.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Factoring and Algebraic Identities","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}